  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the grill to high. Crush or finely chop the garlic. Drain and rinse the chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220804/photos/large/prep_ingredients-7dbb112519e9674d64c0b007b173fe04.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start curry: Heat 1 tbs vegetable oil in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Cook the garlic and 2 tsp curry powder, stirring, for 30 secs or until fragrant. Add the tomatoes, 1 tsp soy sauce, ½ tsp sugar and 125ml (½ cup) water and bring to the boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220806/photos/large/start_curry-4653801722f0579ff8087863c725eeee.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add chickpeas: Reduce the heat to medium-low and cook for 5 mins or until slightly thickened. Add the chickpeas and cook for a further 5 mins or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220808/photos/large/cook_chickpeas-470918e9dff613f1b7260ee77d7156a8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grill pita: Meanwhile, spray or brush 2 pita with vegetable oil. Put on an oven tray and grill for 2 mins each side or until golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220811/photos/large/grill_naan-602eab92e21c3b598727e1298bdf3115.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Stir the spinach leaves into the curry and cook for 1 min or until wilted, then season with pepper. Stir in three-quarters of the yoghurt and remove the pan from the heat. Divide the curry among bowls, drizzle with the remaining yoghurt and serve with the grilled pita. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220814/photos/large/serve_up-cd8eee43553bf409609e2b2425af6f14.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it herby: If you have some on hand, scatter over a handful of coriander leaves for a burst of freshness.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220816/photos/large/make_it_yours-5e15be0332de44531c4e0787626fecbb.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
